B.Np=new A.z("Busy City","The city is full of people. Kiko remembers: stay polite in the city too.","Be polite anywhere \u2014 not only at home.",B.M)
B.RY=new A.z("Red Light","The light is still red. Many are in a hurry, but Kiko waits.","Wait your turn patiently \u2014 rules keep everyone safe.",B.M)
B.Pn=new A.z("Crosswalk","Cross the street at the right spot, look left and right.","Follow road rules \u2014 it keeps you and others safe.",B.M)
B.Pj=new A.z("Bus Queue","The bus stop is crowded. Kiko queues neatly, no cutting in.","Queue in order \u2014 fair, and comfy for all.",B.M)
B.Pf=new A.z("Sorting Bins","The city has colorful bins for sorting trash.","Sort your trash \u2014 a clean city starts with one step.",B.F)
B.Oa=new A.z("City Library","Kiko borrows a book. Note the return date carefully.","Return it on time \u2014 others want to read it too.",B.az)
B.Or=new A.z("Forgotten Book","A friend left a book on the bench. Kiko knows whose it is.","Return others' things \u2014 no matter how small.",B.az)
B.Pb=new A.z("Extra Change","The shopkeeper gives too much change by mistake. Kiko notices.","Extra is not your luck \u2014 return it honestly.",B.az)
B.Rw=new A.z("Dropped Money","Rp10,000 fell on the sidewalk. Kiko knows whose it is.","What is not yours, return it. Honesty makes you rich.",B.az)
B.NZ=new A.z("Honest Seller","The seller weighs her goods honestly and exactly.","Support the honest \u2014 buy from those who weigh fairly.",B.az)
B.Qq=new A.z("City Park","The park is green and cool. Do not step on the grass or pick flowers.","Care for public places like your own home.",B.F)
B.PH=new A.z("Lost Child","A little child cries looking for their mom. Walk them to the guard post.","Help those in trouble \u2014 do not ignore them in a crowd.",B.t)
B.QD=new A.z("The Guard","The guard watches the building all day. Greet and thank him.","Appreciate those who keep you safe.",B.U)
B.OK=new A.z("Save Power","The classroom light is on but the room is empty. Kiko turns it off.","Save power and water \u2014 the Earth and the bill thank you.",B.M)
B.O7=new A.z("Honest in a Test","The test is hard. Kiko could peek, but chooses to be honest.","A grade from cheating is empty \u2014 honesty makes you proud.",B.az)
B.Nw=new A.z("A Friend's Promise","Kiko promised to play at 4. Arriving on time keeps the promise.","Keep small promises \u2014 people learn to trust you.",B.az)
B.Q9=new A.z("Careless Litter","Someone drops trash on the street. Kiko picks it up and bins it right.","Set a good example \u2014 do not follow the wrong.",B.F)
B.Pk=new A.z("Pedicab Driver","Pak Dimas the pedicab driver works hard. Pay the right fare.","Pay what you promised \u2014 a small but important promise.",B.az)
B.R_=new A.z("Sharing Lunch","A friend forgot their lunch. Kiko shares his.","Share with those in need \u2014 the heart grows rich.",B.t)
B.OE=new A.z("A Seat for Grandma","The bus is full. An old lady is standing. Kiko gives his seat.","Give your seat to the old and weak \u2014 that is polite.",B.U)
B.Ro=new A.z("Honesty Shop","A small shop with no clerk. Pay and take your change yourself.","Honest when no one watches \u2014 that is true honesty.",B.az)
B.PO=new A.z("Found Wallet","Kiko finds a wallet with money. Report it to the officer.","A valuable find is not yours \u2014 report it.",B.az)
B.O0=new A.z("Group Work","The school task is split into groups. Share the work fairly.","Everyone does their part \u2014 that is fair and light.",B.M)
B.R9=new A.z("Clean the City River","The people work together to clear trash from the city river.","A clean river means a healthy city. Pitch in too.",B.F)
B.Q6=new A.z("Thank the Workers","The cleaners work at dawn. Kiko says thank you.","Appreciate others' work with sincere words.",B.U)
B.PK=new A.z("Honest City Kid","The last day in the city. The final boss awaits!","A good city means honest people. Start with yourself.",B.az)
