B.Rg=new A.z("First Dive","Kiko dives into the deep sea. Beautiful and lively!","Every adventure needs courage plus care.",B.t)
B.Py=new A.z("Colorful Fish","Colorful fish swim in the reef. Look, do not chase.","Enjoy the beauty without disturbing \u2014 that is respect.",B.t)
B.RU=new A.z("Drifting Trash","Trash from the river reaches the sea. Where does it come from?","Trash on land ends up in the sea \u2014 bin it right.",B.F)
B.Nr=new A.z("Rainbow Coral","Rainbow coral is home to thousands of fish. Do not step on it.","Broken coral grows for hundreds of years \u2014 tread carefully.",B.F)
B.NY=new A.z("Tangled Turtle","A turtle is tangled in plastic. Help free it gently.","Help a creature in trouble \u2014 no matter how small.",B.t)
B.QZ=new A.z("Starfish","A starfish is stranded on a dry rock. Return it to the water.","Help the helpless get back to their home.",B.t)
B.Qs=new A.z("Clever Octopus","An octopus hides in an old bottle. Give it a natural home.","Use less plastic \u2014 so animals keep their real homes.",B.F)
B.PQ=new A.z("Mangrove Roots","The mangrove forest is where little fish hide and grow.",u.N,B.t)
B.Qm=new A.z("Ghost Net","An old net is snagged on the coral, putting fish in danger.","Remove the dangerous \u2014 save many small lives.",B.F)
B.O8=new A.z("Murky Water","The sea is murky from land waste. The fish can hardly breathe.","Care for the water at home \u2014 the sea stays clean too.",B.F)
B.Qe=new A.z("Blue Whale","A giant blue whale passes slowly. Give it room and admire it.","The big need not be feared \u2014 just respected.",B.t)
B.OI=new A.z("Microplastic","Plastic breaks into tiny bits, eaten by fish by accident.","Use less single-use plastic \u2014 start with your lunch.",B.F)
B.QS=new A.z("Sick Reef","The coral reef turns white from dirty water. Let us help it heal!","Clean seawater means healthy coral. Start at home.",B.F)
B.S0=new A.z("Stingray","The stingray glides gracefully like it is floating. Just look.","Admire from afar \u2014 do not touch the wild.",B.M)
B.NR=new A.z("Dolphins Help","Dolphins help their hurt friend rise to the surface.","Even animals help each other \u2014 how much more should we.",B.t)
B.Q8=new A.z("Shipwreck","An old shipwreck becomes a new home for many fish.","From the broken, new life can be born.",B.t)
B.PM=new A.z("Wise Fisherman","The fisherman takes just enough fish and spares the small ones.","Take just enough \u2014 leave some for tomorrow.",B.M)
B.Nl=new A.z("Light in the Deep","In the deepest sea, the fish glow on their own. Magical!","There is always beauty, even in the darkest place.",B.t)
B.No=new A.z("Beach Trash","Trash on the beach is carried by waves to the open sea.","Clean the beach \u2014 you protect the whole sea.",B.F)
B.Rc=new A.z("Old Turtle","An old turtle has roamed the oceans. It leaves a message: protect the sea.","Heed the old \u2014 they have seen so much.",B.U)
B.Qn=new A.z("Reef Heals","The coral you cared for turns colorful and healthy again!","Small effort each day brings a big result.",B.F)
B.O4=new A.z("School of Fish","Thousands of fish swim together again. The sea is alive!","When the home is clean, the dwellers come home.",B.t)
B.Na=new A.z("Sea Researcher","The researcher studies the sea so it can be better protected.","Appreciate scientists \u2014 they work for our nature.",B.U)
B.PX=new A.z("Cleanup Dive","Kiko and the team dive to collect trash from the sea floor.","Working together cleans the sea faster.",B.F)
B.NO=new A.z("Shining Sea","The water is clear again, the coral healthy, the fish lively. Lovely!","This is the gift of caring: a healthy nature.",B.t)
B.P_=new A.z("Sea Hero","The last day in the deep ocean. The final boss awaits!","A healthy sea means a healthy Earth. Care for rivers, care for the sea.",B.F)
