B.RR=new A.z("Liftoff","Kiko rides a rocket into space! Almost there.","Great things start with one brave step.",B.t)
B.OR=new A.z("Astronaut Team","In the rocket, each astronaut has a job. Kiko holds his part.","A team is strong when everyone does their job.",B.M)
B.Pc=new A.z("Zero Gravity","Things float in space. Tidy them up so nothing gets lost.","Be neat and orderly \u2014 wherever you are.",B.M)
B.NX=new A.z("Earth from Above","From the window, Earth looks small, blue, and beautiful.","Earth is our only home \u2014 take good care of it.",B.t)
B.O9=new A.z("Moon Footprint","A footprint on the moon can last thousands of years. Step carefully.","Every step leaves a mark \u2014 choose the good ones.",B.M)
B.NC=new A.z("Save Oxygen","In space, air and water are limited. Use just enough.","Save the limited \u2014 in space and on Earth.",B.M)
B.Pr=new A.z("Star Guide","Long ago, sailors used the stars to find their way.","Learn from those before us \u2014 knowledge is a legacy.",B.U)
B.Ru=new A.z("A Comet Passes","A comet passes only once in thousands of years. Lucky to see it!","Be patient for good things \u2014 and thankful when they come.",B.t)
B.Qf=new A.z("Space Station","In the tight station, many astronauts live together kindly.","A tight space feels cozy when everyone is polite.",B.t)
B.PG=new A.z("Red Planet","Mars is dusty and cold. The scientists want to understand it.","Curiosity takes people far \u2014 keep it alive.",B.M)
B.Rj=new A.z("Asteroid Belt","Many space rocks fly by. The team reminds each other to stay safe.","Remind each other for good \u2014 that shows you care.",B.t)
B.R2=new A.z("Signal to Earth","Kiko sends good news to his family back on Earth.","Tell your loved ones \u2014 they are always waiting.",B.t)
B.O_=new A.z("Distant Star","The star we see is really light from long ago.","What you do today can have an effect for a long time.",B.M)
B.PU=new A.z("Warm Sun","The sun gives light and energy to the whole Earth.","Bring good to many people, like the sun.",B.t)
B.S4=new A.z("Ringed Planet","Saturn has lovely rings of ice and rock. Amazing!","Learning makes us admire nature even more.",B.U)
B.NT=new A.z("Giant Telescope","A giant telescope can see far galaxies. The work of scientists.","Value the hard work of those who advance knowledge.",B.U)
B.Rt=new A.z("Meteor Shower","Meteors streak by like falling stars. Kiko makes a good wish.","Make good dreams real with effort, not just hope.",B.M)
B.Ni=new A.z("Weather Satellite","A satellite watches the weather, helping farmers and fishermen on Earth.","Knowledge used to help \u2014 that is great knowledge.",B.t)
B.NU=new A.z("Vast Galaxy","The galaxy is so vast. We are small, but we still matter.","However small you are, your kindness matters.",B.M)
B.Pt=new A.z("Rocket Trouble","One part of the rocket breaks. The team fixes it calmly.","Face problems calmly and work together.",B.M)
B.P7=new A.z("Help a Mate","Another astronaut struggles outside the capsule. Kiko lends a hand.","When a friend is in trouble, do not hesitate to help.",B.t)
B.QB=new A.z("Space Mystery","Much in space is still unsolved. Kiko stays curious.","Keep learning without fear \u2014 that is the key to being smart.",B.M)
B.Oe=new A.z("Getting Ready to Go Home","The mission is almost done. Kiko misses his family on Earth.","However great the adventure, home is still special.",B.t)
B.OU=new A.z("Safe Landing","The rocket lands smoothly thanks to the whole team working together.","Big success is always the result of working together.",B.M)
B.QE=new A.z("Stories to Friends","Kiko shares his space knowledge and stories with his friends.","Share good knowledge \u2014 kindness becomes contagious.",B.t)
B.Rp=new A.z("Space Explorer","The last day in outer space. The final boss awaits!","Return to Earth as a better person. That matters most.",B.M)
